  "privacyPolicyContent": "# PRIVACY POLICY\n\n## 1. INTRODUCTION\nSciSolve is dedicated to protecting the confidentiality and privacy of information entrusted to us. This Privacy Policy outlines our practices regarding the collection, use, and safeguarding of personal and technical data processed through our application. By accessing or using our services, you acknowledge and agree to the terms described herein.\n\n## 2. DATA COLLECTION SCOPE\nWe collect specific categories of data to facilitate service delivery:\n### A. Personal Information\nIncludes full name, academic level, and authentication credentials provided voluntarily during registration.\n### B. Academic Content\nQueries, mathematical problems, and images submitted for AI analysis and resolution.\n### C. Technical Telemetry\nDevice specific information, operating system details, and performance logs collected automatically to ensure system stability and optimize user experience.\n\n## 3. PURPOSE OF PROCESSING\nData is processed strictly for the following objectives:\n### A. Service Execution\nTo analyze scientific inputs and generate accurate, step-by-step educational explanations.\n### B. Model Refinement\nTo utilize anonymized query data for the continuous training and accuracy enhancement of our AI algorithms.\n### C. Personalization\nTo tailor educational content and complexity levels based on the user's academic profile.\n### D. System Integrity\nTo monitor for security breaches, unauthorized access, and to maintain the overall reliability of the platform.\n\n## 4. DATA DISCLOSURE AND SHARING\nSciSolve maintains a strict policy against the sale or commercialization of user data. Data sharing is restricted to:\n### A. Infrastructure Providers\nTrusted third-party cloud service providers purely for hosting and computational purposes, bound by strict non-disclosure agreements.\n### B. Legal Compliance\nIn circumstances where disclosure is mandated by law or judicial process.\n\n## 5. SECURITY MEASURES\nWe implement industry-standard security protocols, including end-to-end encryption for data in transit and at rest, alongside rigorous access controls to protect against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction of information.\n\n## 6. USER RIGHTS AND CONTROL\nUsers strictly retain ownership of their personal data. The application provides mechanisms to access, rectify, or permanently delete account information. Account deletion requests result in the removal of personal identifiers from our active databases.\n\n## 7. POLICY AMENDMENTS\nThis policy is subject to periodic review to ensure alignment with evolving technological and regulatory landscapes. Continued usage of the application constitutes acceptance of any revised terms.",
  
  "termsContent": "# TERMS AND CONDITIONS\n\n## 1. BINDING AGREEMENT\nAccessing or using the SciSolve application constitutes a definitive agreement to be bound by these Terms and Conditions. These terms govern the contractual relationship between the user and the service provider.\n\n## 2. LICENSE GRANT AND RESTRICTIONS\nSciSolve grants a revocable, non-exclusive, non-transferable, limited license to use the application strictly for personal educational and research purposes. The user explicitly agrees NOT to:\n### A. Commercial Use\nExploit the service for any commercial purpose, resale, or unauthorized distribution.\n### B. Reverse Engineering\nEngage in reverse engineering, decompilation, or disassembly of the software.\n### C. Misuse\nUtilize the application for academic dishonesty, plagiarism, or any unlawful activities.\n\n## 3. DISCLAIMER OF WARRANTIES AND LIABILITY\nThe services are provided on an \"AS IS\" and \"AS AVAILABLE\" basis. While we strive for high precision, the application utilizes probabilistic AI models which may occasionally yield inaccuracies. SciSolve explicitly disclaims all warranties regarding the absolute correctness of results and shall not be liable for any academic or professional consequences resulting from reliance on the application's outputs.\n\n## 4. USER RESPONSIBILITIES\nThe user is solely responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of account credentials and for all activities that occur under their account. The user warrants that all registration information provided is accurate and current.\n\n## 5. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY RIGHTS\nAll intellectual property rights inherent in the application, including source code, algorithms, user interfaces, and trademarks, remain the exclusive property of SciSolve. Nothing in these terms grants the user any right, title, or interest in the intellectual property regarding the service.\n\n## 6. TERMINATION OF ACCESS\nSciSolve reserves the right to suspend, terminate, or restrict access to the service at any time, for any reason, including but not limited to a violation of these Terms, without prior notice or liability.\n\n## 7. GOVERNING LAW\nThese Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the applicable laws of the jurisdiction in which the service operator is registered, without regard to conflict of law principles.",
  
  "helpContent": "# HELP CENTER\n\n## How SciSolve Works\nSciSolve utilizes advanced AI models to parse scientific text and imagery. Simply type your question or capture a photo of a problem, and the system will analyze it to provide a step-by-step solution.\n\n## Account Management\n*   **Password Reset:** You can reset your password via the 'Forgot Password' link on the login screen.\n*   **Updating Profile:** Modify your name and education level via Settings > Edit Profile.\n*   **Account Deletion:** To permanently delete your account, please proceed to the bottom of the Settings menu.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n*   **App Unresponsive:** Ensure you have an active internet connection and are running the latest version of the app.\n*   **Camera Issues:** Ensure adequate lighting and focus when capturing equations for optimal recognition accuracy.\n\n## Subscriptions & Billing\nSubscriptions are managed directly through your device's app store (Apple App Store or Google Play). To cancel or modify your plan, please visit your account settings within the respective store.\n\n## Privacy & Security\nYour data is fully encrypted and secure. We do not share personal information with unauthorized third parties. For more details, please review the Privacy Policy in the Settings menu.",

